        "created_at": "2012-12-18T17:44:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A great comic shop in my town, Whitby, ON., recently started a monthly gaming meet-up. &nbsp;On Jan 20th (our 3rd meet-up), I am hoping to introduce some people to SotM (and the Rook City expansion I just picked up :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Would love to meet fellow players! &nbsp;I've only played 4 games of SotM myself, and it would be great to find some people in my area that would like to play more often. &nbsp;Or maybe I'll just be a lonely Canuck.</p><p><a href=\"http://www.comicbookaddiction.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">www.comicbookaddiction.com</a> for location. &nbsp;The meet-up is on their event calendar.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:02.604Z",
